{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "fanqie-rank-male",
  "site": "fanqienovel.com",
  "revision": 1,
  "match": {
    "host": [
      "fanqienovel.com"
    ],
    "pathPrefix": [
      "/rank/"
    ]
  },
  "dataset": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "pos",
        "type": "number",
        "label": "序号"
      },
      {
        "name": "name",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "书名",
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "name": "author",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "作者"
      },
      {
        "name": "category",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "分类"
      },
      {
        "name": "metric",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "指标"
      },
      {
        "name": "bookId",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "书籍ID"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "http",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://fanqienovel.com/rank/{seg1}_{seg2}",
      "headers": {
        "accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "extract",
      "from": "html",
      "engine": "embedded-json",
      "path": "$.rank.book_list[*]",
      "map": {
        "pos": "$index",
        "name": "$.bookName",
        "author": "$.author",
        "category": "$.category",
        "metric": "$.readCount",
        "bookId": "$.bookId"
      }
    }
  ],
  "verify": {
    "minRecords": 3,
    "requiredFieldsNonEmpty": [
      "name"
    ],
    "uniqueBy": [
      "bookId"
    ]
  },
  "provenance": {
    "createdBy": "human",
    "createdAt": "2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z",
    "sampleHash": "real-fetch-2026-11-19",
    "successRate": 1
  },
  "_notes": [
    "番茄榜单：https://fanqienovel.com/rank/{seg1}_{seg2}，seg1=1 男频 / 0 女频，seg2 是榜单编号（旧插件 FANQIE_RANKS 里定义）。",
    "数据在 window.__INITIAL_STATE__ 的 rank.book_list（2026-11-19 实抓核对，10 条）。",
    "旧插件额外对每本书请求 fanqieBookMeta 拿干净书名/作者；配方只做一次请求，书名字段可能带私用区字符（PUA）。",
    "category 在实测数据里为空字符串——番茄把分类放在 categoryV2 数组里，是否要取需要人工确认，暂不猜。",
    "metric 用 readCount（在读人数原始值）；旧插件会格式化成「在读X万」，配方保留原始值，格式化交给下游。",
    "本配方默认不启用（feature flag 关闭），生产仍走 plugins/novel-platform.mjs。"
  ]
}
